                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/8861: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-05-09T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 9, 1927—3
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>212. Your 528, May 7, 5 p.m. Your instruction May 7, 5 p.m., to Foochow
                    approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
